<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH F.A. CUP SIXTH ROUND DRAW.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH F.A. CUP SIXTH ROUND DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The draw for the sixth round of the English F.A. Cup made on Sunday:</p>
<p>Sheffield Wednesday v Wimbledon</p>
<p>Portsmouth v Leicester City or Chelsea</p>
<p>Derby County or Coventry City v Middlesbrough</p>
<p>Chesterfield v Wrexham</p>
<p>Matches to be played on March 8 and 9</p>
